      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"single\"><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"61ddc89f-7f09-44ed-aacb-5efe1c21b470\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><span>Bahmni Mart is now packaged with Bahmni LITE and docker-compose. You can see the demo here: <ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Bahmni Lite Environments\" ri:version-at-save=\"21\" /></ac:link>. You can try it out locally using docker by following the steps here: <ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Running Bahmni on Docker\" ri:version-at-save=\"48\" /></ac:link>. You can see a short <strong>DEMO video</strong> here: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IHZR-W7EdNg\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IHZR-W7EdNg</a><br /></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><p><span style=\"font-size: 20.0px;\">About&nbsp;</span></p><p>Bahmni-mart is a Standalone Batch Application based on spring-batch. Bahmni-mart aims to simplify reporting for Bahmni.</p><h2>Deployment Steps</h2><p>Check this&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/bahmni-msf/bahmni-mart#deployment-steps\">link (Github)</a> to get deployment steps for Bahmni-mart.</p><h2>Dev Setup</h2><p>Check this <a href=\"https://github.com/bahmni-msf/bahmni-mart#setting-up-dev-environment\">link (Github)</a> for dev setup steps.</p><h2>PPT on Bahmni-mart</h2><p><br /></p><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"view-file\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"f7b2b127-4349-4d21-a5f4-b21109155264\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"name\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Data Flattening using Bahmni Mart for Wiki.pdf\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"height\">250</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p><p><strong>PDF</strong></p><p><br /></p><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"view-file\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"9580104f-3146-4ab9-ab56-f41e68471499\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"name\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Data Flattening using Bahmni Mart for Wiki.pptx\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"height\">250</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p><p><strong>VERSION</strong></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"16cde402-001e-42c2-9a3b-cdba3aa8a36d\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(29,28,29);\">&nbsp;Before running the playbook, add the below line in&nbsp;</span>/etc/bahmni-mart-playbook/<span style=\"color: rgb(29,28,29);\">setup.yml file and run playbook&nbsp;</span></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0b779f45-0023-46ac-b9d6-fbff00201f9a\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">js</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[bahmni_mart_url: \"https://github.com/bahmni-msf/bahmni-mart/releases/download/2.0.4/bahmni-mart-2.0.4.noarch.rpm\"]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><h2>Bahmni-mart PDF Documentation</h2><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"view-file\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"e8b02762-16e8-4e2b-bbeb-1cc8bccd70a4\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"name\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"BAH-311220-1230.pdf\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"height\">250</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p><p><br /></p><h2>Bahmni Mart Installation &amp; Configuration</h2><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"children\" ac:schema-version=\"2\" ac:macro-id=\"b58564bb-6186-4942-b368-6004b1f95747\" /></p><h2>Related articles</h2><p><ac:placeholder>Related articles appear here based on the labels you select. Click to edit the macro and add or change labels.</ac:placeholder></p><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"contentbylabel\" ac:schema-ver