    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\"><style>[data-colorid=d74z12aia0]{color:#1d1c1d} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=d74z12aia0]{color:#e3e2e3}[data-colorid=p6v23tb9ge]{color:#1d1c1d} html[data-color-mode=dark] [data-colorid=p6v23tb9ge]{color:#e3e2e3}</style>\n<div class=\"columnLayout single\" data-layout=\"single\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"61ddc89f-7f09-44ed-aacb-5efe1c21b470\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p><span>Bahmni Mart is now packaged with Bahmni LITE and docker-compose. You can see the demo here: <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3037757441/Bahmni+Lite+Environments\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3037757441\" data-linked-resource-version=\"39\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Bahmni Lite Environments</a>. You can try it out locally using docker by following the steps here: <a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/299630726/Running+Bahmni+on+Docker\" data-linked-resource-id=\"299630726\" data-linked-resource-version=\"48\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Running Bahmni on Docker</a>. You can see a short <strong>DEMO video</strong> here: <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IHZR-W7EdNg\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IHZR-W7EdNg</a><br /></span></p></div></div><p><br /></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20.0px;\">About&nbsp;</span></p><p>Bahmni-mart is a Standalone Batch Application based on spring-batch. Bahmni-mart aims to simplify reporting for Bahmni.</p><h2 id=\"BahmniMart-DeploymentSteps\">Deployment Steps</h2><p>Check this&nbsp;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/bahmni-msf/bahmni-mart#deployment-steps\" rel=\"nofollow\">link (Github)</a> to get deployment steps for Bahmni-mart.</p><h2 id=\"BahmniMart-DevSetup\">Dev Setup</h2><p>Check this <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/bahmni-msf/bahmni-mart#setting-up-dev-environment\" rel=\"nofollow\">link (Github)</a> for dev setup steps.</p><h2 id=\"BahmniMart-PPTonBahmni-mart\">PPT on Bahmni-mart</h2><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper conf-macro output-inline\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"f7b2b127-4349-4d21-a5f4-b21109155264\" data-macro-name=\"view-file\"><a class=\"confluence-embedded-file\" href=\"/wiki/download/attachments/695959553/Data%20Flattening%20using%20Bahmni%20Mart%20for%20Wiki.pdf?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1652705545932&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-nice-type=\"PDF Document\" data-file-src=\"/wiki/download/attachments/695959553/Data%20Flattening%20using%20Bahmni%20Mart%20for%20Wiki.pdf?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1652705545932&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3008888872\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"695959553\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Data Flattening using Bahmni Mart for Wiki.pdf\" data-mime-type=\"application/pdf\" data-has-thumbnail=\"true\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-media-id=\"30be1356-2eb2-4e20-b870-d0002d490ac2\" data-media-type=\"file\"><img src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/695959553/Data%20Flattening%20using%20Bahmni%20Mart%20for%20Wiki.pdf?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1652705545932&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;viewType=fileMacro\" height=\"250\" /></a></span></p><p><strong>PDF</strong></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper conf-macro output-inline\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"9580104f-3146-4ab9-ab56-f41e68471499\